This package contains utility functions derived from the Nexty reference
applications and the existing biubiuniu `packages/utils` implementation. The
`cn` class-name helper and its clsx/tailwind-merge dependencies are maintained
by the UI package rather than redistributed here.

The package-level ISC metadata is retained from the existing package. It does
not assert that every upstream or application-derived source incorporated in
this repository has been re-licensed under ISC. Review the upstream source
notices and contribution terms before publishing or redistributing this
candidate.
